      "writtenOn": "2023-05-26T15:28:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi pomini@,\n\nSorry for late answer here. The main intention for ACTION_DEVICE_CUSTOMIZATION_READY is for a customization client on device to notify system services like wallpaper or ringtones to refresh due to that a customization have been done. The intent is only supposed to be sent early at first boot of a newly flashed device. If a user has managed to set his own wallpaper or ringtone the device should not override that.\n\nAs you can imagine the intent basically happens once per device, the reload of the wallpaper resource is to make sure that the customization works and that a user choosen wallpaper is not affected. Live wallpapers are not customized so far.",
      "parentUuid": "516a251e_cdc2a091",
      "revId": "a71fb1062fccfcd5c9dd2f7d6cfc9b4c55203565",
